_ids": ["F0001", "F0007", "F0053", "F0058"]}, {"observation": "The promotional screens describe the service using terms including \"100% DECENTRALIZED\" and \"IMMUTABLE SMART CONTRACT.\"", "frame_ids": ["F0018", "F0024"]}]}, "annotation": {"binary_label": "Scam", "primary_subtype": "S06", "content_role": "promotion", "contextual_rationale": "This video is scam content because it promotes a rapid-wealth opportunity by presenting Forsage as a way to become a millionaire in 100 days, earn from home, and use a supposedly stable smart-contract platform. It directly encourages participation through a displayed joining payment of 0.05 ETH, the commands \"JOIN US NOW\" and \"GRAB THIS OPPORTUNITY,\" and a website for more information.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The promotion displays Forsage X3/X4 participation screens alongside a paid join instruction and recruitment-oriented calls to action, indicating a matrix-style earning opportunity rather than neutral blockchain education or market commentary. The rapid-millionaire promise and direct enrollment flow support classifying the central mechanism as recruitment commissions and tiered matrices.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The title frames Forsage as a route to becoming a millionaire within 100 days, a rapid-wealth promise.", "source_id": "TITLE_0001", "quote": "Forsage Blockchain Smart Contract: Door to Becoming a Millionaire in 100 Days."}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The frame shows a Forsage X3 participation screen with the text \"ONLY .05 ETH TO JOIN\" and the large word \"OPPORTUNITY\".", "source_id": "F0048", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The frame displays the direct call to action \"JOIN US NOW\".", "source_id": "F0050", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "The frame directs viewers to \"visit www.forsage.io\" for more information, establishing an external participation pathway.", "source_id": "F0053", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E005", "observation": "The frame pairs the instruction \"DON'T WASTE YOUR TIME\" with displayed earnings figures on a phone, using urgency and earnings imagery to encourage participation.", "source_id": "F0028", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E006", "observation": "The frame shows a Forsage X3 interface and describes the offer as an \"OPPORTUNITY,\" reinforcing that the video is advertising participation rather than explaining blockchain technology neutrally.", "source_id": "F0045", "quote": ""}]}}
